silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_01_concrete_anchor_cocone_leg_n silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchorCoconeLegStageN', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, For l=BodyMassQuality77 and n=1, the cocone leg is the arrow BodyMassQuality77 -> Mittens typed \"Mittens is the bearer of this body-mass quality\". This is a specific arrow in C admitted by the 2026-04-12 vet event.." .
